            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s107",
                "printed_page": "39",
                "text": "And all accept upon themselves the yoke of the Kingdom of Heaven, one from the other, and grant each other permission to sanctify their Creator in tranquillity of spirit with pure speech and pleasantness, they all chime the sanctification together and say in fear:",
